{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"beachy-bellicose-chickadee","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Problem\n`origin/main` is currently RED on the CI **Module-size gate**: `src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py` is **803 LOC**, exceeding the absolute 800-LOC hard cap (`.github/module-size-limit.txt`). The gate (`.github/workflows/_build-and-test.yml`) scans ALL `src/rebar/**/*.py` files globally, so this makes EVERY open Gerrit change receive `Verified -1` — no change can land until the file is brought back under the cap.\n\nEvidence:\n- `git show origin/main:src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py | wc -l` -> 803\n- Main branch \"Test Suite (mirror)\" run 30934939148 (commit 05cb) FAILED on the Module-size gate.\n- Change 1377 (story e34a) Verified -1 solely due to this gate; the file is unmodified by that change.\n- The file crossed the cap around commit 339262b990 (\"af11: silence unrelated ambiguity in close scan\").\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] `src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py` is <= 800 LOC (target 200-500), split ONLY along an existing call-graph seam per the module-size policy — not a mechanical trim that creates a <100-LOC file.\n- [ ] The CI Module-size gate passes on main and on new Gerrit changes (Verified reachable again).\n- [ ] Existing `tests/unit/test_transition_close.py` behavior is unchanged (no behavioral regression from the split).","id":"ce14-01c6-a26f-4096","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"transition_close.py (803 LOC) exceeds 800-LOC module-size cap — main CI red, blocks all Gerrit changes"},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1785865762496769001,"uuid":"15e4a0aa-7893-4489-b9c6-8bc4d0896479"}